          "viz": "<svg viewBox='0 0 660 148' role='img' aria-label='三维打分：收益 / 风险 / 工期，权重可调' style='width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #DDD8CB;border-radius:10px;background:#fff' font-family=\"system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif\"><rect x='0' y='0' width='660' height='148' fill='#FBFaf6'/><text x='12' y='20' font-size='9' fill='#4d565b'>三维打分的好处是可解释：每一项得分多少、权重多少，能逐条说清</text><rect x='30' y='36' width='190' height='88' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='44' y='56' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>A 井得分构成</text><text x='44' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>收益 0.82 × 0.55 = 0.45</text><text x='44' y='90' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>风险 0.70 × 0.30 = 0.21</text><text x='44' y='106' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>工期 0.60 × 0.15 = 0.09</text><text x='44' y='124' font-size='9' fill='#2f7d6b'>合计 0.75</text><rect x='240' y='36' width='190' height='88' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='254' y='56' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>B 井得分构成</text><text x='254' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>收益 0.68 × 0.55 = 0.37</text><text x='254' y='90' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>风险 0.88 × 0.30 = 0.26</text><text x='254' y='106' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>工期 0.85 × 0.15 = 0.13</text><text x='254' y='124' font-size='9' fill='#2f7d6b'>合计 0.76</text><rect x='450' y='36' width='198' height='88' rx='4' fill='#efece1' stroke='#e2ded0'/><text x='464' y='56' font-size='9.5' fill='#4d565b'>权重敏感性</text><text x='464' y='74' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>风险权重 +10%</text><text x='464' y='90' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>→ B 井反超 A 井</text><text x='464' y='110' font-size='8.5' fill='#c9613f'>→ 排序会变，必须提示</text><text x='12' y='140' font-size='8.5' fill='#79828a'>分项可查 = 可汇报：黑箱分数在这里没有说服力</text></svg><div class='viz-cap'>图：三维打分：收益 / 风险 / 工期，权重可调</div>"
